    "body": "Found with the Terminal test of `findLink`: `Can't get every «class DTcn» of \"/Users/.../file.pdf\". (-1728)`. Inside `tell application id \"DNtp\"`, `contents of candidate` is read as DEVONthink's \"content\" class, so the lookup never worked and every PDF opened in the fallback viewer.\n\n- `findLink` loops over the paths outside the tell block; `linkInDatabases` gets a plain text variable; `waitForDatabases` holds the wait loop.\n- Settings errors are kept (`cfgError`) and logged even with debug off. Open question: `readConfig` returned `cfgDebug:false` for a config with `DT_OPEN_DEBUG=1`; the cause is not known yet, the error will now show in `tell s to readConfig()` and in the log.\n- README.org config block follows the committed config (`DT_OPEN_DEBUG=1` while troubleshooting).\n- Not run on a Mac.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX)_",
