                    "name": "Claude"
                },
                "message": "🐛 fix: DT Open PDF lookup failed with -1728 inside the DEVONthink tell block\n\nInside tell application id \"DNtp\", \"contents of candidate\" was read as\nDEVONthink's own \"content\" class: \"Can't get every «class DTcn» of <path>\".\nEvery lookup therefore failed and every PDF went to the fallback viewer.\nfindLink now loops over the paths outside the tell block and gives\nlinkInDatabases only a plain text variable (waitForDatabases and\nlinkInDatabases keep the tell blocks small).\n\nAlso keeps an error from reading the settings file (cfgError) instead of\nswallowing it, and writes it to the log even when debug is off, since the\nsettings were not being applied (DT_OPEN_DEBUG=1 gave cfgDebug false).\nREADME.org's config block now matches the committed config (debug on while\ntroubleshooting). Not run on a Mac.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "82ed1fd7d26058e1d5a3ad9efe3e7dca27006fb8",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/siainbuletin/dotfiles/git/trees/82ed1fd7d26058e1d5a3ad9efe3e7dca27006fb8"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/siainbuletin/dotfiles/git/commits/f5a7a5e4325fbca28ddeed665009adeefe1adf44",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree 82ed1fd7d26058e1d5a3ad9efe3e7dca27006fb8\nparent 55a5e3fd61752f07247d36340f080d0481217f52\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1794435761 +0200\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1794435761 +0200\n\n🐛 fix: DT Open PDF lookup failed with -1728 inside the DEVONthink tell block\n\nInside tell application id \"DNtp\", \"contents of candidate\" was read as\nDEVONthink's own \"content\" class: \"Can't get every «class DTcn» of <path>\".\nEvery lookup therefore failed and every PDF went to the fallback viewer.\nfindLink now loops over the paths outside the tell block and gives\nlinkInDatabases only a plain text variable (waitForDatabases and\nlinkInDatabases keep the tell blocks small).\n\nAlso keeps an error from reading the settings file (cfgError) instead of\nswallowing it, and writes it to the log even when debug is off, since the\nsettings were not being applied (DT_OPEN_DEBUG=1 gave cfgDebug false).\nREADME.org's config block now matches the committed config (debug on while\ntroubleshooting). Not run on a Mac.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX\n",
